  "scope": "A331 bounded8-row parser metadata/cache-prefetch pipeline on current exact4096 private front-cache and canonical-view shared interner. Existing full parser per row, precompute identical sampled32 rejection hash once then prefetch private slot, intern and append in original per-worker order. Full bytes still decide cache identity; globalfullhash, key capacity, fulluint32 escapes, first-line, hour disorder, quantiles/output/threads/flags/PGO unchanged. Partial batches and long-key global fallback preserved by design. This may cost extra metadata/source/loops and lose. Need new pending-span/partial/collision/long/guard/prefetch/exact-source strict/race/untrained/GCC/image/default/all29 proof before promotion. No seed/outputcache/host/counter/harness/exemption change.",
